		// Configuration baseline BL-001 'Verification baseline': approved by TL for the team, with the instructor on 2026-10-22.
		// Content: model v0.5 of Riverside Food Bank Network: 13 requirements, 13 verification cases (1 run), 9 physical parts and components, 10 interfaces and connections. The SHA-256 of this file is recorded in the audit file. SysML v2 keeps baselines at the repository level (an API tag on a commit); this comment records the team's approval.
		// --- generated by the Week 12 lab tool: end ---
