// Riverside Food Bank Network: SysML v2 model v0.2 (Week 9: needs and requirements).
// Generated by the Week 9 lab tool on 2026-10-21 from model v0.1 (Week 8) and the Week 1 and Week 2 model inputs.
// Course conventions: every Phase I ID is a quoted short name; a need is a requirement usage with the enterprise as subject,
