		// Validation activities (course convention; SysML v2 has no validation construct): the need, how the stakeholders judge that it is met in use, and who judges.
		// NEED-002 Safe temperatures: A week of spot checks of the pantry fridges by the health inspector at three pantries. Judged by: County health inspector.
		// NEED-005 Early warning of storage failure: The warehouse manager runs a night drill: a freezer door is left open and the call is timed. Judged by: TL.
		// Configuration baseline BL-001 'Verification baseline': approved by TL for the team, with the instructor on 2026-10-22.
